<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><div><font face="arial">As a high-achieving scholar, I encourage you to apply to <a href="http://barretthonors.asu.edu">Barrett, The Honors College</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You will benefit from being part of a fully developed four-year residential scholar community that combines the considerable resources of a premier Research Extensive university with the close, personal attention provided by our award-winning Barrett faculty and dedicated staff.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The unique <a href="http://barretthonors.asu.edu/academics/honors-courses-and-contracts/">honors curriculum</a> integrates seamlessly into ASU degree requirements to enhance the academic experience. You will have meaningful professor and advisor relationships and exclusive internship, research and study abroad opportunities.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Barrett students attend the best graduate schools, have exceptional success in national fellowship competitions and accept positions with prominent nonprofit and Fortune 500 companies.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Students interested in Barrett, The Honors College must first apply to Arizona State University and then complete the separate <a href="http://barretthonors.asu.edu/admissions/">Barrett application</a>. Be mindful of deadlines to ensure your complete application is on file by the appropriate date.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know if I can answer any questions about the honors experience at ASU.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>